WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.410
I was using ChatGPT to do the same things.

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.340
For a while I used ChatGPT to do the same things,

3
00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:11.840
and it's impossible to do what you do with RelAI

4
00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:13.790
and get the same results.

5
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.390
Even in a short time: with ChatGPT it's impossible.

6
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.980
Ok, thank you.

7
00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:27.480
You'd basically have to rebuild RelAI. You'd have to rebuild RelAI,

8
00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:30.210
everything we've done, and so build software

9
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:35.030
that uses ChatGPT but connected to a database, with the information…

10
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.830
It's already done, guys.

11
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.330
We're giving it to you. And above all: does ChatGPT remind you to

12
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.790
contact Mario,

13
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:49.350
who you wrote to two weeks ago and who told you «I'm on holiday, call me back in September»?

14
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.220
ChatGPT will never do that.

15
00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.460
So we're always at the same point:

16
00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.970
you spend hours and hours working with ChatGPT, creating messages, sending them,

17
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:02.760
and then you'll never do the follow-ups, because you forget and you don't have time.
